<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en"/><updated>2025-12-06T09:55:04+00:00</updated><id>https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/feed.xml</id><title type="html">blank</title><subtitle>A simple, whitespace theme for academics. Based on [*folio](https://github.com/bogoli/-folio) design. </subtitle><entry><title type="html">APS DFD 2025</title><link href="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2025/APS-DFD-2025/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="APS DFD 2025"/><published>2025-11-25T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-11-25T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2025/APS-DFD-2025</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2025/APS-DFD-2025/"><![CDATA[<p>With the support from Prof. H. Jane Bae and DFD Travel Award, I was honored to have the opportunity to present at the American Physical Society 78th Annual Meeting of the Division of Fluid Dynamics (<a href="https://www.aps.org/events/2025/78th-dfd-annual-meeting">APS DFD 2025</a>), Houston. During the interactive session, we shared our research on the <em> Analogous dynamics of Couette-Poiseuille flows and adverse-pressure-gradient turbulent boundary layers</em> and received valuable feedback and suggestions. Click <a href="https://archive.aps.org/dfd/2025/e27/5/">here</a> for our abstract.</p> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/APS1-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/APS1-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/APS1-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/APS1.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> Hello, APS! </div> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/APS2-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/APS2-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/APS2-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/APS2.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> During my 1-minute talk. </div> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/APS3-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/APS3-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/APS3-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/APS3.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> At my poster. </div> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/APS4-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/APS4-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/APS4-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/APS4.png" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> A photo with other group members at dinner. </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="Academia"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[My first presentation at an academic conference.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Internship at Caltech</title><link href="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2025/Internship-at-Caltech/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Internship at Caltech"/><published>2025-07-14T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-07-14T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2025/Internship-at-Caltech</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2025/Internship-at-Caltech/"><![CDATA[<p>Thanks to Senior Undergraduate Research Fellowship (SURF) from TEEP, Tsinghua, and Visiting Undergraduate Research Program (VURP) from Caltech, I had an opportunity to join <a href="https://bae.caltech.edu/">Bae Research Group</a> as a visiting researcher for six months. I will be working on the similarities across wall-bounded turbulence under the guidance of Professor H. Jane Bae.</p> <p>It’s a pleasure to meet everyone!</p> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Caltech-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Caltech-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Caltech-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Caltech.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="Academia"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Looking forward to working under the guidance of Professor H. Jane Bae.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">ICCES 2025</title><link href="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2025/ICCES-2025/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="ICCES 2025"/><published>2025-05-26T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-05-26T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2025/ICCES-2025</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2025/ICCES-2025/"><![CDATA[<p>With the support from Prof. Chunxiao Xu, I had the opportunity to attend the 31st International Conference on Computational &amp; Experimental Engineering and Sciences (<a href="https://2025.iccesconf.org/">ICCES 2025</a>) in Changsha, China. Our presentation was titled <em> Inflow turbulence generation for adverse-pressure-gradient turbulent boundary layers based on an equivalent boundary-layer model. </em></p> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/ICCES-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/ICCES-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/ICCES-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/ICCES.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> A photo with other group members. </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="Academia"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[The first academic conference I attended.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">The 6th Tsinghua University Magic Gala: Marvels and Oddities</title><link href="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2024/6-Magic-Gala/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="The 6th Tsinghua University Magic Gala: Marvels and Oddities"/><published>2024-11-22T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2024-11-22T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2024/6-Magic-Gala</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2024/6-Magic-Gala/"><![CDATA[<p>The Tsinghua University Magic Gala is an annual event supported by ‘Tsinghua Student Club Development Program’ and organized by Tsinghua University Student Magic Club. I was honored to serve as chief stage manager of the 6th Tsinghua University Magic Gala, <em> Marvels and Oddities </em> (光怪陆离). The gala featured 13 magic shows, with a duration of approximately 2 hours and an audience of around 250. Click <a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iRcDewEEj/?spm_id_from=333.1387.homepage.video_card.click">here</a> for the full recording of the gala.</p> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Marvels1-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Marvels1-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Marvels1-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Marvels1.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3 w-50 mx-auto d-block" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> Poster of the gala. </div> <swiper-container keyboard="true" navigation="true" pagination="true" pagination-clickable="true" pagination-dynamic-bullets="true" rewind="true"> <swiper-slide> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Marvels3-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Marvels3-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Marvels3-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Marvels3.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </swiper-slide> <swiper-slide> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Marvels4-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Marvels4-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Marvels4-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Marvels4.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </swiper-slide> <swiper-slide> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Marvels5-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Marvels5-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Marvels5-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Marvels5.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </swiper-slide> <swiper-slide> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Marvels6-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Marvels6-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Marvels6-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Marvels6.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </swiper-slide> <swiper-slide> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Marvels8-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Marvels8-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Marvels8-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Marvels8.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </swiper-slide> </swiper-container> <div class="caption"> Snapshots of the gala, including <em> For Her Fans </em> from Xiu Zhong, <em> The Red Rose </em> from Jie Pan and Yuanhang Zhang, <em> Floral Whisper </em> from Xiaohan Gong, <em> Tied-Up </em> from Cancao Guo and <em> Chaos </em> from Sihan Li. </div> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Marvels2-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Marvels2-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Marvels2-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Marvels2.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> I'm working as the Stage Manager. </div> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Marvels7-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Marvels7-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Marvels7-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Marvels7.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> Final bow of the entire cast and crew. </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="Magic"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[My first stage-manager experience]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Tsinghua’s 2024 New Year Gala</title><link href="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2023/New-Year-Gala/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Tsinghua’s 2024 New Year Gala"/><published>2023-12-31T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2023-12-31T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2023/New-Year-Gala</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2023/New-Year-Gala/"><![CDATA[<p>I was honored to perform my original 20-minute magic show, <strong><em> Departure </em></strong>, at Tsinghua’s 2024 New Year Gala, in front of an audience of over 2,000. In the show, I invited a random volunteer on stage and asked them to name their ideal travel destination. On the giant boarding pass at the center of the stage, their name and chosen destination were already printed! Click <a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1PZ421U7b8/?spm_id_from=333.1387.homepage.video_card.click">here</a> for the full performance video.</p> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/New1-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/New1-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/New1-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/New1.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> An opening card magic </div> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/New2-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/New2-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/New2-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/New2.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> The cards turned into plane tickets. </div> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/New3-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/New3-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/New3-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/New3.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> On the giant boarding pass were written the volunteer's name and chosen destination. </div> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/New6-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/New6-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/New6-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/New6.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> After the show, the boarding pass was left at the exit, where the audience eagerly signed it as a keepsake, symbolizing <strong><em> Departure </em></strong> in the New Year. </div> <p>I am deeply grateful to all the friends and teachers who supported me throughout the preparation and performance, including Chengzi, Cancao, Kunda, Xiu, Hongyu, Junhao, Jiawei, Sihan, Yuqian, Xiaohan, and others.</p> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/New7-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/New7-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/New7-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/New7.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> My sincere thanks to all the staff members involved in the show. </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="Magic"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[My craziest magic show, Departure , an original 20-minute show for an audience of over 2,000.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">The 5th Tsinghua University Magic Gala: Into the Wondrous Way</title><link href="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2023/5-Magic-Gala/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="The 5th Tsinghua University Magic Gala: Into the Wondrous Way"/><published>2023-12-10T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2023-12-10T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2023/5-Magic-Gala</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2023/5-Magic-Gala/"><![CDATA[<p>The Tsinghua University Magic Gala is an annual event supported by ‘Tsinghua Student Club Development Program’ and organized by Tsinghua University Student Magic Club. I was honored to serve as both the executive director and a performer for the 5th Tsinghua University Magic Gala, <em> Into the Wondrous Way </em> (悟入奇途). The gala was narrated from the perspective of ‘Mr. Rabbit’ and featured 14 magic shows and 1 singing performance, with a duration of approximately 2 hours and an audience of around 250. Click <a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yN4y1b7Q7/?spm_id_from=333.1387.homepage.video_card.click">here</a> for the full recording of the gala.</p> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Into1-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Into1-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Into1-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Into1.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3 w-50 mx-auto d-block" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> Poster of the gala. </div> <swiper-container keyboard="true" navigation="true" pagination="true" pagination-clickable="true" pagination-dynamic-bullets="true" rewind="true"> <swiper-slide> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Into4-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Into4-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Into4-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Into4.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </swiper-slide> <swiper-slide> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Into2-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Into2-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Into2-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Into2.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </swiper-slide> <swiper-slide> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Into3-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Into3-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Into3-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Into3.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </swiper-slide> <swiper-slide> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Into5-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Into5-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Into5-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Into5.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </swiper-slide> <swiper-slide> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Into6-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Into6-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Into6-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Into6.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </swiper-slide> </swiper-container> <div class="caption"> Snapshots of the gala, including <em> Life </em> from Sihan Li, <em> Spatial Curvature </em> from me, <em> The Promise </em> from Jiawei Zhang, <em> Newton’s Fury </em> from Kunda Liu and <em> The Ultimate Brain </em> from Xiaofeng Ma. </div> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Into7-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Into7-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Into7-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Into7.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> Group photo of the entire cast and crew. Thanks to everyone for their efforts! (That’s me lying...) </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="Magic"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[My first director experience]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Tsinghua’s 2023 Freshman Welcome Gala</title><link href="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2023/Freshman-Welcome-Gala/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Tsinghua’s 2023 Freshman Welcome Gala"/><published>2023-09-13T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2023-09-13T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2023/Freshman-Welcome-Gala</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://zhengqin-shu.github.io/blog/2023/Freshman-Welcome-Gala/"><![CDATA[<p>It was my first time performing on a giant stage, with an audience of over 3000 freshmen from the Class of 2023. I presented a story about the growth of the trees. Finally, it was in the <strong><em> Spring of Ten Thousand Woods </em></strong>, when the trees finally turned into a sailing ship setting off on a faraway voyage.</p> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/Freshmen-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/Freshmen-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/Freshmen-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/Freshmen.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 mt-3" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="caption"> The woods were turned into a sailing ship setting off on a faraway voyage. </div> <p>I am deeply grateful to the friends and teachers who supported me, including Chengzi, Jinwei, Jiawei, and others.</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="Magic"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[My first large-scale stage show, Spring of Ten Thousand Woods , presented to all the Class of 2023 freshmen at Tsinghua.]]></summary></entry></feed>